  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00035",
    "start_seconds": 87.44,
    "end_seconds": 91.48,
    "text": "You can also work the other way around."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00036",
    "start_seconds": 89.76,
    "end_seconds": 93.32,
    "text": "So, if you're already working within"
