  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00038",
    "start_seconds": 93.32,
    "end_seconds": 98.08,
    "text": "Paperpile button there, as well."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00039",
    "start_seconds": 96.0,
    "end_seconds": 100.44,
    "text": "So, if you're mid-conversation, you can"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00040",
    "start_seconds": 98.08,
    "end_seconds": 103.0,
    "text": "click the Paperpile button, search your"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00041",
    "start_seconds": 100.44,
    "end_seconds": 104.76,
