  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00042",
    "start_seconds": 103.0,
    "end_seconds": 106.52,
    "text": "there. That's awesome when you're"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00043",
    "start_seconds": 104.76,
    "end_seconds": 108.12,
    "text": "already in a thread and you don't want"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00044",
    "start_seconds": 106.52,
    "end_seconds": 110.88,
    "text": "to go back and restart the whole"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00045",
    "start_seconds": 108.12,
    "end_seconds": 110.88,
    "text": "process."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00046",
    "start_seconds": 115.32,
    "end_seconds": 119.88,
    "text": "We've also built a dedicated prompt"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00047",
    "start_seconds": 117.4,
    "end_seconds": 122.12,
    "text": "library specifically for real-world"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00048",
    "start_seconds": 119.88,
    "end_seconds": 124.56,
    "text": "research tasks. So, these aren't generic"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00049",
    "start_seconds": 122.12,
    "end_seconds": 126.16,
    "text": "prompts like summarize this paper."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00050",
    "start_seconds": 124.56,
    "end_seconds": 128.36,
    "text": "They're built around the kind of things"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00051",
    "start_seconds": 126.16,
    "end_seconds": 130.8,
    "text": "researchers actually want to do."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00052",
    "start_seconds": 128.36,
    "end_seconds": 133.959,
    "text": "Summarization, comparison, data"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00053",
    "start_seconds": 130.8,
    "end_seconds": 136.56,
    "text": "extraction, critique, and language. For"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00054",
    "start_seconds": 133.959,
    "end_seconds": 138.48,
    "text": "example, the structured summary. This"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00055",
    "start_seconds": 136.56,
    "end_seconds": 141.32,
    "text": "gives you a one-page summary with"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00056",
    "start_seconds": 138.48,
    "end_seconds": 142.84,
    "text": "sections like methods, findings, and"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00057",
    "start_seconds": 141.32,
    "end_seconds": 144.8,
    "text": "significance."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00058",
    "start_seconds": 142.84,
    "end_seconds": 147.4,
    "text": "So, rather than getting back a summary"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00059",
    "start_seconds": 144.8,
    "end_seconds": 150.56,
    "text": "paragraph, you get something with a very"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00060",
    "start_seconds": 147.4,
    "end_seconds": 150.56,
    "text": "clear structure."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00061",
    "start_seconds": 153.16,
    "end_seconds": 157.48,
    "text": "If you're comparing several papers, you"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00062",
    "start_seconds": 155.12,
    "end_seconds": 159.6,
    "text": "can choose from multiple prompts. For"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00063",
    "start_seconds": 157.48,
    "end_seconds": 162.16,
    "text": "example, you can use the meta-analysis"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00064",
    "start_seconds": 159.6,
    "end_seconds": 164.72,
    "text": "table prompt to create a table comparing"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00065",
    "start_seconds": 162.16,
    "end_seconds": 167.32,
    "text": "methods, sample sizes, findings, and"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00066",
    "start_seconds": 164.72,
    "end_seconds": 168.76,
    "text": "themes across multiple studies."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00067",
    "start_seconds": 167.32,
    "end_seconds": 170.88,
    "text": "Uh this works really well when you're"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00068",
    "start_seconds": 168.76,
    "end_seconds": 173.04,
    "text": "trying to make sense of a set of related"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00069",
    "start_seconds": 170.88,
    "end_seconds": 175.8,
    "text": "papers and want a really structured"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00070",
    "start_seconds": 173.04,
    "end_seconds": 175.8,
    "text": "overview."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00071",
    "start_seconds": 176.4,
    "end_seconds": 180.68,
    "text": "We've included prompts to help you think"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00072",
    "start_seconds": 178.24,
    "end_seconds": 182.92,
    "text": "critically about papers, too. For"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00073",
    "start_seconds": 180.68,
    "end_seconds": 184.76,
    "text": "example, the critical questions prompt"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00074",
    "start_seconds": 182.92,
    "end_seconds": 187.12,
    "text": "generates a set of questions you might"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00075",
    "start_seconds": 184.76,
    "end_seconds": 189.76,
    "text": "get about a paper in a research talk,"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00076",
    "start_seconds": 187.12,
    "end_seconds": 191.68,
    "text": "journal club, or supervision meeting."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00077",
    "start_seconds": 189.76,
    "end_seconds": 193.72,
    "text": "So, you can use these to go beyond"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00078",
    "start_seconds": 191.68,
    "end_seconds": 197.36,
    "text": "understanding a paper and actually"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00079",
    "start_seconds": 193.72,
    "end_seconds": 199.32,
    "text": "prepare to discuss it."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00080",
    "start_seconds": 197.36,
    "end_seconds": 201.32,
    "text": "We've also added prompts that are just"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00081",
    "start_seconds": 199.32,
    "end_seconds": 205.2,
    "text": "for fun, like making a social media"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00082",
    "start_seconds": 201.32,
    "end_seconds": 205.2,
    "text": "thread based on a paper."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00083",
    "start_seconds": 207.16,
    "end_seconds": 211.04,
    "text": "We've designed these so that you can use"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00084",
    "start_seconds": 208.84,
    "end_seconds": 212.72,
    "text": "them as they are or treat them as"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00085",
    "start_seconds": 211.04,
    "end_seconds": 215.36,
    "text": "starting points and adjust them to your"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00086",
    "start_seconds": 212.72,
    "end_seconds": 215.36,
    "text": "needs."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00087",
    "start_seconds": 221.48,
    "end_seconds": 226.36,
    "text": "What about AI hallucinations such as"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00088",
    "start_seconds": 224.32,
    "end_seconds": 228.76,
    "text": "inaccurate quotes, wrong page numbers,"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00089",
    "start_seconds": 226.36,
    "end_seconds": 230.4,
    "text": "made-up links, or claims stated too"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00090",
    "start_seconds": 228.76,
    "end_seconds": 232.96,
    "text": "confidently?"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00091",
    "start_seconds": 230.4,
    "end_seconds": 236.28,
    "text": "For example, the AI says Smith et al."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00092",
    "start_seconds": 232.96,
    "end_seconds": 237.64,
    "text": "2023 proved X, but you're not sure if"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00093",
    "start_seconds": 236.28,
    "end_seconds": 240.28,
    "text": "it's true."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00094",
    "start_seconds": 237.64,
    "end_seconds": 242.48,
    "text": "In Paperpile, these citations are live"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00095",
    "start_seconds": 240.28,
    "end_seconds": 245.12,
    "text": "links. So, when you see a page number"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00096",
    "start_seconds": 242.48,
    "end_seconds": 247.959,
    "text": "link in the output, you can click it and"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00097",
    "start_seconds": 245.12,
    "end_seconds": 250.4,
    "text": "Paperpile will open the PDF at the"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00098",
    "start_seconds": 247.959,
    "end_seconds": 252.28,
    "text": "relevant page or quotation."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00099",
    "start_seconds": 250.4,
    "end_seconds": 254.8,
    "text": "This means you don't have to search"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00100",
    "start_seconds": 252.28,
    "end_seconds": 257.239,
    "text": "through a paper trying to work out where"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00101",
    "start_seconds": 254.8,
    "end_seconds": 259.48,
    "text": "the AI got something from."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00102",
    "start_seconds": 257.239,
    "end_seconds": 261.359,
    "text": "The PDF viewer snaps exactly to the"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00103",
    "start_seconds": 259.48,
    "end_seconds": 263.88,
    "text": "highlight, so you can check it for"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00104",
    "start_seconds": 261.359,
    "end_seconds": 266.48,
    "text": "yourself. So, your AI chat becomes an"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00105",
    "start_seconds": 263.88,
    "end_seconds": 269.32,
    "text": "interactive index that is grounded in"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00106",
    "start_seconds": 266.48,
    "end_seconds": 269.32,
    "text": "your papers."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00107",
    "start_seconds": 272.48,
    "end_seconds": 276.68,
    "text": "Now, let's talk about Notebook LM"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00108",
    "start_seconds": 274.32,
    "end_seconds": 278.68,
    "text": "because it works a bit differently."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00109",
    "start_seconds": 276.68,
    "end_seconds": 281.12,
    "text": "Most AI assistants are built around"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00110",
    "start_seconds": 278.68,
    "end_seconds": 282.6,
    "text": "short-lived chat threads, meaning that"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00111",
    "start_seconds": 281.12,
    "end_seconds": 284.88,
    "text": "you'll import your papers from"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00112",
    "start_seconds": 282.6,
    "end_seconds": 287.4,
    "text": "Paperpile, ask a prompt, and then move"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00113",
    "start_seconds": 284.88,
    "end_seconds": 290.04,
    "text": "on. Notebook LM is useful when you're"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00114",
    "start_seconds": 287.4,
    "end_seconds": 292.48,
    "text": "working on something bigger. Instead of"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00115",
    "start_seconds": 290.04,
    "end_seconds": 295.0,
    "text": "a chat thread, it creates a notebook."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00116",
    "start_seconds": 292.48,
    "end_seconds": 297.0,
    "text": "And that notebook can hold a much larger"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00117",
    "start_seconds": 295.0,
    "end_seconds": 299.64,
    "text": "collection of papers. When you send"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00118",
    "start_seconds": 297.0,
    "end_seconds": 301.919,
    "text": "papers to Notebook LM from Paperpile,"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00119",
    "start_seconds": 299.64,
    "end_seconds": 304.32,
    "text": "Ask AI creates a new notebook and"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00120",
    "start_seconds": 301.919,
    "end_seconds": 306.56,
    "text": "uploads the PDFs there."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00121",
    "start_seconds": 304.32,
    "end_seconds": 308.52,
    "text": "And when Notebook LM cites something,"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00122",
    "start_seconds": 306.56,
    "end_seconds": 310.919,
    "text": "you can hover over the citation chip and"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00123",
    "start_seconds": 308.52,
    "end_seconds": 314.04,
    "text": "click through to the quoted text in the"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00124",
    "start_seconds": 310.919,
    "end_seconds": 314.04,
    "text": "source PDF."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00125",
    "start_seconds": 314.88,
    "end_seconds": 320.32,
    "text": "There are a few practical things to know"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00126",
    "start_seconds": 316.8,
    "end_seconds": 322.08,
    "text": "before you use Ask AI. First, make sure"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00127",
    "start_seconds": 320.32,
    "end_seconds": 324.44,
    "text": "you're signed in to the AI assistant"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00128",
    "start_seconds": 322.08,
    "end_seconds": 326.72,
    "text": "that you want to use before you start"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00129",
    "start_seconds": 324.44,
    "end_seconds": 328.919,
    "text": "because Paperpile uses whichever account"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00130",
    "start_seconds": 326.72,
    "end_seconds": 331.0,
    "text": "is currently signed in."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00131",
    "start_seconds": 328.919,
    "end_seconds": 333.44,
    "text": "Secondly, some free accounts can be"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00132",
    "start_seconds": 331.0,
    "end_seconds": 336.48,
    "text": "restrictive, particularly ChatGPT and"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00133",
    "start_seconds": 333.44,
    "end_seconds": 338.52,
    "text": "Claude can have tight PDF limits on free"
  },
